We have operator: we need to assign operator for each candidate before confirm_operator_alignment; after that we can release operator before moving to next candidate.

We have vehicle: we need to allocate vehicle for each candidate before confirm_candidate_preparedness; after dispatch we release vehicle.

We have dispatch slot: allocate before execute, release after.

