Step38: confirm_operator_alignment SA Op: pre: constraint_applied SA, candidate_operator_linked SA Op? Wait after we released operator, candidate_operator_linked SA Op is false. So precondition fails. Indeed confirm_operator_alignment requires candidate_operator_linked ?candidate ?operator_resource. So we need operator linked at that point. So we cannot release operator before confirm_operator_alignment. We must keep operator linked until after confirm_operator_alignment. Then we can release.

Thus adjust: after assign_operator_resource, we keep operator linked, then do confirm_operator_alignment, then release.

Thus steps:

